    - DOLA -> YieldStrategyDola (ERC4626YieldStrategy) -> PhusdStableMinter
      \-> ERC4626YieldStrategy wraps MockAutoDOLA (ERC4626 vault)
    - USDC -> YieldStrategyUSDC (ERC4626YieldStrategy) -> PhusdStableMinter
      \-> ERC4626YieldStrategy wraps MockAutoUSDC (ERC4626 vault)
  
  StableYieldAccumulator Configuration:
    - Reward token: USDC (MockRewardToken)
    - Discount rate: 20% (2000 basis points)
    - Yield strategies registered: YieldStrategyDola, YieldStrategyUSDC
    - Phlimbo set as reward recipient
    - Minter set for yield queries
    - Authorized as withdrawer on all yield strategies
  
  Reward Flow:
    - Yield accrues in yield strategies
    - StableYieldAccumulator gathers yield and offers to users for discounted USDC
    - USDC is then injected into Phlimbo via collectReward()
    - Phlimbo distributes rewards to stakers
  
  Global Pauser System:
    - Pauser contract deployed with MockEYE token
    - PhusdStableMinter registered with Pauser
    - PhlimboV2 and PhlimboV3 registered with Pauser
    - StableYieldAccumulator registered with Pauser
    - StableStaker registered with Pauser
  StableStaker: 10% set-aside buffer on all 3 pools (DOLA, USDC, USDe)
    - Burn 1000 EYE to trigger global pause
  
  Initial Seeding:
    - 5000 DOLA deposited to YieldStrategyDola via minter.mint()
    - Deployer received 5000 PhUSD
    - YieldStrategyDola now has positive balance
  
  DOLA Yield Seeding:
    - 1000 DOLA deposited directly to MockAutoDOLA vault
    - This increases share value for YieldStrategyDola
    - ERC4626YieldStrategy can claim this yield via StableYieldAccumulator
  
  USDC Seeding:
    - 5000 USDC deposited to YieldStrategyUSDC via minter.mint()
    - Deployer received 5000 PhUSD
    - YieldStrategyUSDC now has positive balance
  
  USDC Yield Seeding:
    - 1000 USDC deposited directly to MockAutoUSDC vault
    - This increases share value for YieldStrategyUSDC
    - ERC4626YieldStrategy can claim this yield via StableYieldAccumulator
  
  NFTMinter Infrastructure:
    - NFTMinter (ERC1155) deployed for claim gating
    - BurnRecorder retained (burn totals now zero on EYE/SCX/Flax)
    - UniboostEYE dispatcher (index 1: boosts EYE/WETH9 UniV2 pool)
    - UniboostSCX dispatcher (index 2: boosts SCX/USDS UniV2 pool)
    - UniboostFLX dispatcher (index 3: boosts FLX/DOLA UniV2 pool)
    - BalancerPooler dispatcher (index 4: sUSDS single-sided add to phUSD/sUSDS pool)
    - GatherWBTC dispatcher (index 5: accumulates WBTC to deployer)
    - StableYieldAccumulator authorized as NFT burner
    - NFTMinter registered with Global Pauser
  
  Local rehearsal toggles + sweeps (script-audit run-26):
    - LOCAL_PROMO_KENDU (Kendu promo armed on PhlimboV3): false
      DORMANT leg: promoToken == address(0) - the day-one mainnet shape
      Unset LOCAL_PROMO_KENDU (or set it true) to boot the ARMED chain
    - Phase 7.6: index-1 dispatcher swap rehearsed (pull -> setDispatcher -> setHook -> replaceDispatcher)
    - Terminal sweep: deployer phUSD mint authority REVOKED, end-state ACL asserted

